 communication systems, and mission-critical networking solutions designed to support organisations operating in remote and challenging environments."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 511\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g><path d=\"M256 131.469c13.273 0 24.066-10.797 24.066-24.067 0-13.273-10.796-24.07-24.066-24.07s-24.066 10.797-24.066 24.07c0 13.27 10.796 24.067 24.066 24.067m0-33.137c5 0 9.066 4.07 9.066 9.07 0 4.996-4.066 9.067-9.066 9.067s-9.066-4.067-9.066-9.067 4.066-9.07 9.066-9.07m0 0\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"1\" data-original=\"#000000\"></path><path d=\"M504.5 461.262h-9.066v-25.633c0-4.14-3.36-7.5-7.5-7.5H462.3v-25.633a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-7.5-7.5h-9.063V230.867h9.063a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 7.5-7.5v-25.633h25.633a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 7.5-7.5v-33.132a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-7.5-7.5H473.71L260.27 1.832a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-8.54 0L38.293 149.602H24.066a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-7.5 7.5v33.132c0 4.141 3.36 7.5 7.5 7.5H49.7v25.633c0 4.14 3.36 7.5 7.5 7.5h9.067v164.13h-9.067a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-7.5 7.5v25.632H24.066c-4.14 0-7.5 3.36-7.5 7.5v25.633H7.5a7.497 7.497 0 0 0-7.5 7.5v33.129c0 4.144 3.355 7.5 7.5 7.5h497c4.145 0 7.5-3.356 7.5-7.5v-33.13a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-7.5-7.5m-57.2-33.133H379.47v-18.133H447.3zm-51.269-33.133V230.867h34.703v164.13zm51.27-179.129h-67.832v-18.133H447.3zm-75.332 15h9.062v164.13h-9.062a7.497 7.497 0 0 0-7.5 7.5v25.632h-59.551v-25.633a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-7.5-7.5h-9.066V230.867h9.066c4.14 0 7.5-3.36 7.5-7.5v-25.633h59.55v25.633a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 7.5 7.5m-149.883-33.133h67.832v18.133h-67.832zm16.562 33.133h34.704v164.13h-34.704zm51.27 179.13v18.132h-67.832v-18.133zM31.566 164.601H162.45a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 7.5-7.5c0-4.145-3.355-7.5-7.5-7.5H64.645L256 17.122l191.36 132.48H192.45a7.5 7.5 0 1 0 0 15h287.984v18.132H31.566zM64.7 197.734h67.836v18.1